#: src/appimage/main.cpp:75
msgid ""
"sde-appimage: run an AppImage after verifying it.\n"
"\n"
"Usage: sde-appimage FILE [ARGUMENTS...]\n"
"       sde-appimage --check FILE\n"
"       sde-appimage --forget FILE\n"
"       sde-appimage --version\n"
"\n"
"An AppImage runs when its signature is valid (and made with the same key as "
"the earlier\n"
"versions of the application) or when it was verified before. Otherwise a "
"window explains\n"
"why and offers to delete it. The administrator's policy is /etc/sde/appimage."
"conf.\n"
msgstr ""

